ui/node_modules/
# ui/dist is COMMITTED on purpose: it is how the Control Room reaches a
# consuming repo. The skill is distributed as a git checkout, there is no build
# step on the consumer side, and without the bundle `brain:serve` serves only
# the "UI is not built yet" fallback — which is exactly what club-ops got.
# tests/ui-bundle.test.mjs fails when the committed bundle is older than ui/src.
